<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan United Micro Jan-Sept profit down.</title>
<headline>Taiwan United Micro Jan-Sept profit down.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-September 1996</p>
<p>		(in million Taiwan $ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				16,443 vs 17,146</p>
<p>    pretax profit			  6,435 vs  9,103</p>
<p>    Net profit			     6,383 vs  N/A</p>
<p>Note - United Microelectronics Corp is Taiwan's second largest semiconductor maker.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
